Different metals have different properties where magic is concerned.

- **Lead** is wholly impervious to the lower ranks of magic.
- **Palladium** can carry magic across vast distances. On [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]], [[People/Dahl|Dahl]] cast through palladium rods driven through his adjutant's arms and legs.
- **Copper** vibrates near magic, and was made into magic detectors on Ushas.
- **Tin** grants extrasensory sight. Some soldiers on Ushas had tin spikes driven through their eyes to give them truesight.
- **[[Phenomena/Holy Gold|Holy gold]]** can strip a god of its divinity.

See also [[Phenomena/Sky Metal|Sky Metal]].
